<section class="py-5 bg-light">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="text-center mb-5">
            <h2 class="fw-bold">Frequently Asked Questions for Coaches</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="accordion" id="faqAccordion">
            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq1">
                    <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse1">
                        What should I include on a coaching invoice?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapse1" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        A coaching invoice should include your name, credentials (if any), business name/logo, client details, invoice number and date, description of services (e.g., "6-session leadership coaching package", "60-min one-on-one session"), session or package fee, number of sessions (if package), any retainers, deposit paid, balance due, taxes, and payment terms (due date, bank details, or payment link).
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq2">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse2">
                        Is this coaching invoice generator really free?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapse2" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        Yes! RatPDF's invoice generator is completely free for coaches. No hidden fees, subscriptions, or watermarks. Create unlimited invoices and download them as PDF files at no cost.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq3">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse3">
                        Can I bill for coaching packages (e.g., 6 sessions)?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapse3" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        Absolutely. Create a line item like "6-session coaching package (valid for 3 months)" with a fixed price. You can also list individual sessions if you prefer per-session billing.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq4">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse4">
                        Does it support monthly retainers?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapse4" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        Yes. Use the recurring invoice approach – create a new invoice each month for the retainer amount. The tool does not auto-send (to keep it free), but you can quickly duplicate the same details each month.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq5">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse5">
                        Do I need to create an account to generate invoices?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapse5" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        No account or sign-up is required. Start creating invoices immediately – we don't store any of your data.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

